2. Modifications (Arphic Public License sec. 2)
-----------------------------------------------

The bundled file is NOT the original distribution. Modified 2026-09 by
tooling/download_hsk1_strokes.dart. What was changed, and how:
  - the `strokes` (stroke outline paths) and `medians` (centre-line point lists)
    fields are extracted and stored as JSON keyed by character;
  - every other field in the source records (pinyin, decomposition and etymology)
    is discarded;
  - a subset (the HSK 1 character set) is shipped rather than the full data set.

